flowchart LR
    subgraph UX[User Experience]
        U[Analyst or Agent] --> CH[Approved Channel<br/>ITSM console / CC desktop]
    end
    subgraph TRUST[Identity and Policy]
        CH --> ID[Identity and<br/>Conditional Access]
        ID --> ORCH[AI Agent<br/>Orchestrator]
        ORCH --> POL[Policy Engine<br/>scopes, injection defense,<br/>output validation]
    end
    subgraph KNOW[Knowledge]
        POL --> RAG[Permission-Aware<br/>Retrieval]
        RAG --> KB[Approved Knowledge<br/>Sources]
    end
    subgraph ACT[Action]
        POL --> TOOLS[Approved Tools<br/>parameter-restricted]
        TOOLS --> ITSM[IT Service<br/>Management]
        TOOLS --> CC[Contact Center<br/>Platform]
    end
    ORCH --> HUMAN[Human Approval<br/>step-up auth]
    HUMAN --> TOOLS
    ORCH --> OBS[Audit, Monitoring,<br/>SIEM]
    RAG -. content treated as untrusted .-> POL

